      "content": "scammony, a gum-resin obtained from the tuberous roots of Convolvulus Scammonia, used in medicine as a strong purgative; also the dried tuberous root from which the drug is prepared (OED s.v. scammony; Heyd 648-9; Stieda, Venice 105-6)"
